<title>SRI LANKA: Sri Lanka Blue up 3.8 pct on bonus news.</title>
<headline>Sri Lanka Blue up 3.8 pct on bonus news.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Blue Diamonds Jewellery Worldwide Ltd rose 3.8 percent, or 0.50 rupees, to 13.50 rupees on Tuesdsay morning after the company announced a bonus issue, brokers said.</p>
<p>&quot;The price rose along with the bonus announcement of three shares for every 40 held,&quot; said one broker.</p>
<p>Blue Diamonds Jewellery is a blue-chip manufacturer of gold and gem-studded jewellery, mostly for exports.</p>
<p>--Colombo newsroom 941-434319</p>
</text>
